          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaherezi bāgenda bandikwa ukw amazu ya ba sekuruza ari; Abalewi uhereye ku bamaze imyaka mirongwibiri no kuja hejuru, bakandikwa ukw ibikorwa vyabo n’imbu zabo biri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi handikwa n’ababo bose, uhereye ku bagore babo n’abahungu n’abakobga, bose iyo bava bakagera; kuko bāgenda bayoboka mu gukora ivyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
