              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu vyo yakora vyose arondera Imana yiwe, uhereye ku bikorwa vyo mu ngoro y’Imana, no ku vyagezwe no ku mabgirizwa, yabikora abishizek’ umutima wiwe wose, bikamubera ko.",
          "type": "text",
